    - query MeasureQuery

PSize(0, 1)

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ progress-repeat-character String
    - character String

|? character == ""
    ""
??
    character * 256
